<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Vinofilo · 产区</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/fenlei/chanqu/</link><description>葡萄酒诞生的地方</description><language>zh</language><atom:link href="https://vinofilo.com/zh/fenlei/chanqu/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Lugana：征服海外的加尔达湖白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/lugana-turbiana-jiaerda-hu-bai-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/lugana-turbiana-jiaerda-hu-bai-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Turbiana葡萄、黏土土壤，以及横跨伦巴第与威内托的DOC：为什么Lugana在海外如此受欢迎，又该如何读懂它的不同类型。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lugana-turbiana-lago-di-garda.jpg?v=23f3eae3" length="223449" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lugana-turbiana-lago-di-garda.jpg?v=23f3eae3" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Soave：不再甘当配角的白葡萄酒，从Classico到Recioto</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/soave-garganega-zhengming/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/soave-garganega-zhengming/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从超市货架上的杯中酒，到火山岩与石灰岩土壤上的Garganega：为什么Soave值得重新发现，从Classico一直到Recioto。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/soave-garganega-riscatto.jpg?v=46f2f4d2" length="333568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/soave-garganega-riscatto.jpg?v=46f2f4d2" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Italia Nostra 红色名单：我们可能失去的美</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/hongse-mingdan-italia-nostra-putaojiu-jingguan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/hongse-mingdan-italia-nostra-putaojiu-jingguan/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>濒危文化遗产的红色名单现已上线。它为何也与爱酒之人有关：葡萄酒正诞生于这片需要守护的风景。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lista-rossa-italia-nostra-paesaggi-del-vino.jpg?v=e0da5443" length="441290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lista-rossa-italia-nostra-paesaggi-del-vino.jpg?v=e0da5443" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>五渔村：拾级而上的葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.21/wuyucun-putaojiu-sciacchetra-titian/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.21/wuyucun-putaojiu-sciacchetra-titian/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>干砌石墙、单轨小火车、Bosco、Albarola和Vermentino。五渔村的葡萄酒与Sciacchetrà甜酒：只要梯田还有人耕种，它就活着。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cinque-terre-sciacchetra.jpg?v=c59ee03c" length="298727" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cinque-terre-sciacchetra.jpg?v=c59ee03c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Valtellina：爬上石墙的山地Nebbiolo，从Sassella到Sforzato</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.19/valtellina-shandi-nebbiolo-shiqiang/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.19/valtellina-shandi-nebbiolo-shiqiang/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>梯田、干砌石墙与Chiavennasca，即Valtellina的山地Nebbiolo如何诞生，从五个分区一直到风干葡萄酿成的Sforzato。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valtellina-nebbiolo-di-montagna.jpg?v=67617835" length="379560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valtellina-nebbiolo-di-montagna.jpg?v=67617835" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Prosecco使用指南：DOC、DOCG、Cartizze与Rive</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.16/prosecco-zhinan-doc-docg-cartizze-rive/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.16/prosecco-zhinan-doc-docg-cartizze-rive/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>DOC、DOCG、Asolo、Cartizze、Rive与Col Fondo：Prosecco地图，从的里雅斯特的小村庄，到Glera葡萄，再到联合国教科文组织认定的山丘。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/prosecco-doc-docg-cartizze.jpg?v=0163ea1c" length="312998" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/prosecco-doc-docg-cartizze.jpg?v=0163ea1c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Barolo与Barbaresco：同一种葡萄，两种性格，相距几公里</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.13/barolo-yu-barbaresco-de-qubie/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.13/barolo-yu-barbaresco-de-qubie/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>产区、土壤、最短陈年期与地理标注：Barolo和Barbaresco这两款被阿尔巴城隔开的Nebbiolo酒，真正的区别在哪里。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/barolo-e-barbaresco-differenze.jpg?v=00070a6a" length="321005" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/barolo-e-barbaresco-differenze.jpg?v=00070a6a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年采收逐区巡礼：最早的一次采摘，与无人愿意给出的数字</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.08/2026-nian-caishou-zhu-chan-qu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.08/2026-nian-caishou-zhu-chan-qu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Franciacorta七月开镰，威尼托与托斯卡纳提前，西西里获好评：2026年采收是怎样过去的，以及为什么今年官方预估落空了。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vendemmia-2026-regione-per-regione.jpg?v=1c90c073" length="375087" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vendemmia-2026-regione-per-regione.jpg?v=1c90c073" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>埃特纳：改写意大利葡萄酒版图的火山</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/aitena-gaixie-yidali-putaojiu-bantu-de-huoshan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/aitena-gaixie-yidali-putaojiu-bantu-de-huoshan/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Nerello Mascalese、Carricante、自根老藤与142个contrade：为什么埃特纳是意大利争议最多的产区，神话之外还有什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/etna-vulcano-del-vino.jpg?v=9c59d149" length="136978" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/etna-vulcano-del-vino.jpg?v=9c59d149" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Chianti与Chianti Classico：两款相邻却并不相像的酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/chianti-yu-chianti-classico-liang-kuan-xianglin-de-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/chianti-yu-chianti-classico-liang-kuan-xianglin-de-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>两个独立的DOCG，一只黑公鸡，一份1716年的公告。一篇讲清Chianti与Chianti Classico区别的指南，从子产区讲到UGA。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/chianti-e-chianti-classico.jpg?v=a72ec2bd" length="298650" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/chianti-e-chianti-classico.jpg?v=a72ec2bd" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>布鲁奈罗·蒙塔尔奇诺：一个比看上去年轻得多的传奇</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.25/brunello-di-montalcino-bi-kanshang-qu-nianqing-de-chuanqi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.25/brunello-di-montalcino-bi-kanshang-qu-nianqing-de-chuanqi/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从比翁迪·桑蒂家族十九世纪的构想，到意大利第一个DOCG，再到“布鲁奈罗丑闻”：一款看似古老的葡萄酒，短暂而浓烈的历史。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/brunello-mito-recente.jpg?v=f7d2bc0c" length="155989" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/brunello-mito-recente.jpg?v=f7d2bc0c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>上阿迪杰：意大利最精准的山地葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.24/shang-adije-yidali-zui-jingzhun-shandi-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.24/shang-adije-yidali-zui-jingzhun-shandi-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>不到意大利葡萄园面积的1%，合作社堪称典范，葡萄园高至一千米：为什么上阿迪杰是意大利最精确的山地葡萄酒产区。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/alto-adige-vino-di-montagna.jpg?v=ababa76d" length="308190" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/alto-adige-vino-di-montagna.jpg?v=ababa76d" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>撒丁岛，一座按自己方式喝酒的岛：Cannonau、Vermentino、Carignano</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.24/sading-dao-cannonau-vermentino-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.24/sading-dao-cannonau-vermentino-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Cannonau的身世之争、Vermentino di Gallura DOCG、Carignano del Sulcis：在独立灌木式树形、西北风与大海之间认识撒丁岛葡萄酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sardegna-cannonau-vermentino.jpg?v=1c107491" length="318665" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sardegna-cannonau-vermentino.jpg?v=1c107491" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>科利奥：意大利白葡萄酒学会认真做酒的地方</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.23/kelio-yidali-baiputaojiu-zhuiqiu-zhijia/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.23/kelio-yidali-baiputaojiu-zhuiqiu-zhijia/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>庞卡土壤、弗留拉诺（原Tocai）、白里波拉、马尔瓦西亚，还有一条穿过葡萄园的国界：为什么科利奥是意大利顶级白葡萄酒的故乡。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/friuli-collio-grandi-bianchi.jpg?v=6673bf09" length="280903" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/friuli-collio-grandi-bianchi.jpg?v=6673bf09" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>明信片之外的普利亚：普里米蒂沃、黑曼罗与特洛亚黑</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/puglia-mingxinpian-zhiwai-primitivo-negroamaro/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/puglia-mingxinpian-zhiwai-primitivo-negroamaro/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从运酒罐车到值得收藏的产区：普里米蒂沃、黑曼罗、特洛亚黑，还有萨伦托的桃红葡萄酒，抛开明信片来讲讲普利亚。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/puglia-primitivo-negroamaro.jpg?v=30cf51aa" length="271887" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/puglia-primitivo-negroamaro.jpg?v=30cf51aa" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item></channel></rss>
